IEC material is not included
----------------------------

IEC publishes machine-readable files for IEC 61850 under its own licence:
the name space definitions (NSD) of IEC 61850-7-2, -7-3, -7-4 and -8-1,
the application templates (ASD) of IEC TR 61850-7-6 and the SCL schema of
IEC 61850-6. This module does not include any of them, nor anything
generated from them. An application that wants the IEC 61850 model or
schema validation loads IEC's files at run time (model.LoadNSD,
scl.LoadSchema), from copies it obtained from IEC under IEC's terms.
No text of the standards is reproduced either: comments cite clause,
table and annex numbers in our own words, and names, codes, tags, octet
layouts and values are used as facts.

Specifications
--------------

IEC 61850 (parts 6, 7-1 to 7-4, 7-6, 8-1, 9-2), IEC 62351 (parts 3, 4, 6,
8, 9), IEC 60870-6 (parts 503, 702, 802), ISO 9506-1/-2 (MMS), ISO 8073,
ISO 8327-1, ISO 8823-1, ISO 8650-1, ITU-T X.690 and the RFCs in
PROVENANCE.md were read in licensed copies or as published.

