Test data
---------

scl/testdata/bay.scd is this module's own test system. Tests use octet
examples of IEC 61850-8-1 Annexes A and C and IEC 61850-9-2 as test
vectors (values, not text). Tests that need IEC's machine-readable files
or SCL files built around the standard's examples read them from the
directories named by IEC61850_CODE_COMPONENTS, IEC61850_DESCRIPTIONS and
IEC61850_SCL_TESTDATA, and are skipped when these are not set. Every
certificate, key, password, address and value in the tests and examples
is generated or a made-up demo value.

The nested test-only module interop/ runs this module against
libiec61850 (GPLv3, MZ Automation) built inside Docker containers at test
time. No libiec61850 code is included in this module or linked into it.
